{% extends "base.html" %}

{% block content %}
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Practical technical consulting for real-world systems and business problems.</h1>
            <p>
                Holtsnider Tech helps small businesses and organizations improve systems,
                troubleshoot technical issues, streamline processes, and build lightweight,
                maintainable solutions.
            </p>
            <p>
                From infrastructure and testing environments to automation and web tools,
                the goal is simple: solve the problem in a way that is clear, practical,
                and sustainable.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>What Holtsnider Tech does</h2>
            <p>
                Holtsnider Tech focuses on hands-on technical problem solving, especially in
                situations where a business needs practical help without unnecessary complexity.
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>Infrastructure and systems troubleshooting</li>
                <li>Lab, test, and validation environment support</li>
                <li>Python automation and internal tools</li>
                <li>Process improvement and technical documentation</li>
                <li>Website and system support for growing organizations</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>How I approach the work</h2>
            <p>
                I believe good technical consulting should reduce confusion, not add to it.
                That means understanding the real problem, working within the client’s actual
                constraints, and building solutions that are maintainable after the initial work
                is done.
            </p>
            <p>
                My approach is grounded, modular, and practical. I prefer clear systems,
                clean communication, and tools that fit the problem instead of forcing a trend
                or a buzzword-driven stack.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Who this is for</h2>
            <p>
                Holtsnider Tech is a strong fit for small businesses, nonprofits, technical teams,
                and independent operators who need someone to bridge the gap between business needs
                and technical execution.
            </p>
            <p>
                Whether the need is troubleshooting, automation, a better internal workflow,
                or a maintainable web presence, the focus stays on delivering useful results.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Let’s talk</h2>
            <p>
                If you need practical technical help, visit the Services page to learn more or
                head to Contact to start the conversation.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
{% endblock %}